hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19","[AI-translation] Aur Abdullah bin Mas'ud se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Beshak har cheez ka sanaam hota hai, aur Qur'an ka sanaam Surah Al-Baqarah hai."
"21","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mera walid hadees sunayi, unka kehna hai ke Jabir ne humein hadees sunayi, kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Safa ki taraf tashreef le gaye aur farmaya: ""Hum us cheez se shuru karte hain jis se Allah ne shuru kiya."" Phir aapne tilawat farmayi: ""Beshak Safa aur Marwah Allah ki sha'air mein se hain."
